{"updated":"2026-10-13T16:34:47.699Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Pope admitted to hospital for surgery to remove lump on his lung. Elsewhere, 🔴 Live: French students ‘not giving up the fight’ as 480,000 join new day of school protests. And majority in US say Trump prioritises personal wealth over all else: Poll. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on US, at active conflict levels, though Ukraine, and Russia are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, took it in stride — the S&P 500 up 1.9 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial down 1.7 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite up 3.4 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 47 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 6.8 near central Mid-Atlantic Ridge. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.12,0.16,0.21,0.23,0.28,0.33,0.36,0.4,0.44,0.48,0.51,0.53,0.57,0.59,0.63,0.74,0.84,0.99,1.26,1.38,1.43,1.46,1.49,1.53,1.56,1.58,1.6,1.65,1.7,1.78,1.83,1.88,1.92,1.96,2.01,2.04,2.08,2.14,2.19,2.24,2.28,2.32,2.37,2.42,2.47,2.51,2.57,2.63,2.69,2.81,2.9,3.02,3.04,3.09,3.12,3.18,3.23,3.3,3.41,3.5,3.56,3.65,3.7,3.76,3.81,3.85,3.9,3.92,3.95,3.99,4.02,4.04,4.06,4.11,4.16,4.24,4.3,4.35,4.41,4.47,4.53,4.56,4.62,4.64,4.7,4.82,4.97,5.14,5.65,5.72,5.84,5.89,5.94,5.98,6.01,6.07,6.13,6.18,6.21,6.27,6.33,6.35,6.38,6.41,6.44,6.53,6.56,6.61,6.68,6.73,6.79,6.84,6.88,6.93,6.98,7.01,7.05,7.08,7.14,7.19,7.28,7.35,7.41,7.46,7.54,7.61,7.67,7.71,7.74,7.83,7.86,7.92,7.98,8.06,8.1,8.15,8.21,8.27,8.34,8.39,8.44,8.51,8.54,8.58,8.64,8.67,8.71,8.74,8.82,8.88,8.97,9.02,9.14,9.31,9.82,9.94,10,10.05,10.1,10.15,10.19,10.23,10.29,10.41,10.44,10.55,10.55,10.55,10.63,10.75,10.81,10.94,10.96,11.05,11.12,11.17,11.2,11.25,11.3,11.33,11.38,11.42,11.49,11.57,11.63,11.68,11.7,11.75,11.79,11.85,11.9,11.97,12.03,12.07,12.12,12.17,12.21,12.26,12.31,12.33,12.35,12.4,12.43,12.48,